{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s54-p01",
      "text": "How can we stop climate change?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p02",
      "text": "How can we live on a green planet?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p03",
      "text": "Scientists agree that one way is to use clean energy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p04",
      "text": "Opposite to the use of fossil fuels, using clean energy does not produce harmful litter.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p05",
      "text": "We just need to learn how to get and store more of it.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p06",
      "text": "Plants can help us learn how to make clean energy, which could have a huge effect on our planet.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p07",
      "text": "The sun is a primary source of energy for plants.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p08",
      "text": "They use sunlight to turn water and air into sugar.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p09",
      "text": "The sugar can be used as food.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p10",
      "text": "The aim of some scientists is to get energy from the sun, like plants do.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p11",
      "text": "During the day and especially around noon, they can gather plenty of sunlight.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p12-01",
      "text": "They want to make a machine that can use the sunlight to make fuel from water,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p12-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p12-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p12-02",
      "text": "which will allow us to use clean energy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p12-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p12-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p13",
      "text": "Water is made up of two different parts.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p14",
      "text": "Breaking water into its parts is hard.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p15",
      "text": "Plants do it all the time though.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p16",
      "text": "With energy from the sun, the new machine will break water into its parts.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p17",
      "text": "One of the parts will be used as fuel.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p18",
      "text": "Then the fuel is used to make electric power.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p19",
      "text": "The electricity can power cars, houses, our laptops, and so on.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p20",
      "text": "This fuel is better for the earth than gasoline or gas.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p21",
      "text": "Burning gasoline produces pollution.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p22",
      "text": "Scientists warn that if we do not act, climate change could lead to disasters and put our planet at risk.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p23",
      "text": "We need to balance traditional energy with clean energy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p24-01",
      "text": "By using clean energy and lending support to its development,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p24-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p24-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s54-p24-02",
      "text": "we can protect our planet and ensure that future generations have the energy they need.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p24-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s54-p24-02.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
